### Variables
# Set WEBHOOK_SECRET to match your .env value
# Token = SHA-256 hex digest of the secret (not HMAC of the body)
# Recompute: printf '%s' 'dev-secret-changeme' | sha256sum
# Bearer token for dev-secret-changeme:
# 65d69bd16304ac87283ef51729c5de9e79b12fde3847bda17a6aa07e86cf2799
#
# Deduplication is based on SHA-256 hash of the request body.
# Sending the same body twice returns 200 + duplicate:true.



### Local — Normal webhook (202 + background processing, full context)
POST http://localhost:8080/webhook/github
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 65d69bd16304ac87283ef51729c5de9e79b12fde3847bda17a6aa07e86cf2799

{"repo":"gugacarbo/user-request-issue-writer","requester":{"name":"Alice","email":"alice@example.com"},"payload":{"descricao":"The login button is broken. When I click it, nothing happens.","url_atual":"https://app.example.com/login","categoria":"bug","contexto_da_sessao":"Chrome 120 on macOS","logs_do_console":"TypeError: cannot read addEventListener","logs_de_rede":"POST /api/login 500"}}

### Local — Duplicate body (same body as above → 200 duplicate:true)
POST http://localhost:8080/webhook/github
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 65d69bd16304ac87283ef51729c5de9e79b12fde3847bda17a6aa07e86cf2799

{"repo":"gugacarbo/user-request-issue-writer","requester":{"name":"Alice","email":"alice@example.com"},"payload":{"descricao":"The login button is broken. When I click it, nothing happens.","url_atual":"https://app.example.com/login","categoria":"bug","contexto_da_sessao":"Chrome 120 on macOS","logs_do_console":"TypeError: cannot read addEventListener","logs_de_rede":"POST /api/login 500"}}

### Local — DryRun (200 + JSON with drafted issue, no createIssue)
POST http://localhost:8080/webhook/github?dryRun=true
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 65d69bd16304ac87283ef51729c5de9e79b12fde3847bda17a6aa07e86cf2799

{"repo":"gugacarbo/user-request-issue-writer","requester":{"name":"Alice","email":"alice@example.com"},"payload":{"descricao":"The login button is broken. When I click it, nothing happens.","url_atual":"https://app.example.com/login","categoria":"bug"}}

### Local — Healthcheck
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### Remote — Normal webhook (replace <host> with your VPS domain/IP)
POST https://<host>/webhook/github
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 65d69bd16304ac87283ef51729c5de9e79b12fde3847bda17a6aa07e86cf2799

{"repo":"gugacarbo/user-request-issue-writer","requester":{"name":"Alice","email":"alice@example.com"},"payload":{"descricao":"The login button is broken. When I click it, nothing happens.","url_atual":"https://app.example.com/login","categoria":"bug"}}

### Remote — DryRun (replace <host> with your VPS domain/IP)
POST https://<host>/webhook/github?dryRun=true
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 65d69bd16304ac87283ef51729c5de9e79b12fde3847bda17a6aa07e86cf2799

